 | Edit account | Admin, owner (own entity) | Profile data and preferences; respect plan limits. |
 | Reset password | Admin, owner | Reset flow for **account** (login) and **user** (entity member), per security policy. |
 | Remove account | Admin, owner | Not applicable to owner while being owner. |
-| Remove user | Admin, owner | Cannot remove the owner; employees lose immediate access to the entity. |
-| Assign role | Admin, owner | Users are **separated by role**; employees receive granular permissions, not admin/owner role. |
+| Remove user | Admin, owner | Cannot remove the owner or the last manager; asks for confirmation; employees lose immediate access to the entity. |
+| Assign role | Admin, owner | Users are **separated by role**; employees receive granular permissions, not admin/owner role. Changed in the member detail modal and applied only on "save role"; the owner's role is immutable and the last manager cannot be demoted. |
+| Invite member | Admin, owner | Membership is **invite-only**: a manager invites an e-mail with role `admin` or `employee` (never `owner`); the invitee gets an e-mail, signs in or registers with that address and accepts or declines. Rejected when the e-mail already belongs to a member or has a pending invite (an expired invite may be replaced). Invites expire after 7 days; at most 10 successful invites per manager and entity per hour. Existing accounts are never revealed or added without consent. |
+| Accept / decline invite | Invitee | Only the user whose e-mail matches (case-insensitive) may accept or decline. Pending invites are listed on onboarding and on the entity switcher. Accepting is idempotent and never duplicates a membership. |
+| View members page | Admin, owner | Employees receive 403. |
 
